y varies with temperature/flow/speed/geometry; no fixed density added."}]},{"topic":"Benefits","items":[{"id":"Q02581","text":"Bambu ASA Aero is a self-foaming material renowned for its exceptional durability and toughness.","source":"B-asa-aero-TDS","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Pitfalls and limitations","items":[{"id":"Q05668","text":"The average density of prints will vary with changes in parameters such as actual printing temperature, flow rate ratio, printing speed, model size, wall thickness and infill density.","source":"R-BAMBU-PRIORITY-20261003-f50ef28e766c","at":"p. 1: exact product features/description/application tips, source text line 119","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement","conditions":"Foaming/process-dependent density, not equivalent to unfoamed TDS filament density."},{"id":"Q05669","text":"Not compatible with Cool Plate SuperTack, Hotend with Hardened Steel Nozzle 0.6 mm / 0.8 mm, and Hotend with Stainless Steel Nozzle 0.2 mm.","source":"R-BAMBU-PRIORITY-20261003-f50ef28e766c","at":"p. 1: exact product features/description/application tips, source text line 159","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement","conditions":"Maker explicit plate/nozzle exclusions retained; no tested universal machine pass inferred."}]},{"topic":"Odour and emissions","items":[{"id":"Q02583","text":"Odor Odorless","source":"B-asa-aero-TDS","at":"p. 3","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]},{"id":"G032-02","name":"Spectrum LW-ASA UltraFoam","maker":"Spectrum","variant":null,"diameter":null,"twins":[],"composition":null,"certifications":null,"availability":null,"claim":null,"values":[{"key":"density","id":"V015859","value":360,"mark":"counted","why":null,"annealed":null,"source":"S-SPECTRUM-en-tds-spectrum-lw-asa-ultrafoam","page":1,"twin":null,"at":"Density (foamed)"},{"key":"tensileModulusXY","id":"V003043","value":1.6,"mark":"apart","why":"not-describe