ded, for optimal layer adhesion.","source":"R-COLORFABB-colorFabb-LW-ASA-TDS","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Printing advice","items":[{"id":"Q02592","text":"At around 230ºC this material will start foaming, increasing its volume by nearly 2,5 times.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-colorFabb-LW-ASA","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q02593","text":"Users can decrease material flow by 60% to achieve light weight parts, or use the expanding properties to effectively reduce print time by using big layer heights or single extra thick perimeters.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-colorFabb-LW-ASA","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q02611","text":"At around 230ºC this material will start foaming, increasing its volume by nearly 2,5 times.","source":"R-COLORFABB-colorFabb-LW-ASA-TDS","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q02612","text":"Users can decrease material flow by 60% to achieve light weight parts, or use the expanding properties to effectively reduce print time by using big layer heights or single extra thick perimeters.","source":"R-COLORFABB-colorFabb-LW-ASA-TDS","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]},{"id":"G032-04","name":"QIDI ASA-Aero","maker":"QIDI","variant":null,"diameter":"1.75 mm","twins":[],"composition":null,"certifications":"agent can be easily controlled. The maximum foaming ratio can reach 250%. Meanwhile, ASA-Aero (p. 2, as printed; a typical value, not a certificate: verify grade, thickness and certificate)","availability":null,"claim":null,"values":[{"key":"tensileModulusXY","id":"V008069","value":0.59399,"mark":"counted","why":null,"annealed":null,"source":"R-QIDI-ASA-AERO","page":2,"twin":null,"admitted":["moisture","treatment"],"at":"杨氏模量(X-Y) Young's Modulus"},{"key":"tensileStrengthXY","id":"V008067","value":8.25,"mark":"count